Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if the oceans disappeared overnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:06.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You stand on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The water pulls back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Farther and farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Until the horizon is mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:18.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ships lie on their sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:21.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The seabed is grey ooze and stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fish lie still in the salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Every port is a dry cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:31.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:33.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rivers shrink to a trickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:35.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The air turns to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.19,0:00:37.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:40.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The seabed canyons stand open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:47.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}About six million years ago, the Mediterranean dried up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:49.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It became a salt desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rivers cut canyons into the empty sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then the Atlantic broke in and filled it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:00:59.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A sea can vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Would you swim?
